---
import data from '../../../data/templates/borddeau.json';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer id="contact" class="py-14" style="background:#0F2A36; color:#F4F8F7; border-top:1px solid rgba(244,248,247,0.10);">
  <div class="max-w-content mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
    <div>
      <div class="font-bebas text-4xl">BORD D'EAU</div>
      <p class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] mt-1 font-bold" style="color:#FF6B5A;">ÉCOLE DE SURF · RÉUNION</p>
    </div>
    <div class="text-[14px]" style="color:#D8E0E0;">
      <div class="font-bebas text-xl mb-2" style="color:#3CACAE;">CONTACT</div>
      <a href={`tel:${data.info.telephoneHref}`}>{data.info.telephone}</a><br/>
      <a href={`mailto:${data.info.email}`}>{data.info.email}</a><br/>
      Cabane plage · côte ouest
    </div>
    <div class="text-[14px]" style="color:#D8E0E0;">
      <div class="font-bebas text-xl mb-2" style="color:#3CACAE;">SESSIONS</div>
      Tous les jours · selon mer<br/>2 créneaux matin · 2 après-midi<br/>Sur réservation · 24h à l'avance
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="max-w-content mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 mt-10 pt-5 border-t text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] font-bold" style="border-color:rgba(244,248,247,0.10); color:#5A7080;">© {year} BORD D'EAU — DÉMONSTRATION 9SITE4</div>
</footer>
